e class=3D"docsearch-exclude rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-sm">inventor=
y_available</code>, <code class=3D"docsearch-exclude rounded bg-muted px-1 =
py-0.5 text-sm">order_state</code>), and a few outputs (<code class=3D"docs=
earch-exclude rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-sm">order_fulfilled</code>,=
 <code class=3D"docsearch-exclude rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-sm">ord=
